# perceive_semantix_interfaces/action/SearchObject.action

# Search for the object a text query asks for, e.g. "the yellow ball". The goal sets the query of layer 2, which the
# exploration map follows. It succeeds once the object is found: an instance whose current view a vision-language
# model judged to show what the query asks for and that is present with at least query.found_presence_threshold.
# Cancelling clears the query; a new goal aborts the running one, as does a query that cannot be interpreted.

# Goal
string query
---
# Result
ObjectDetection object  # the instance at which the query is found (empty unless succeeded)
string caption          # its caption
---
# Feedback
